  "title": "Baked Coconut French Toast",
  "description": "Coconut French toast is easy to assemble the night before and then just pop it in oven for 30 minutes the next morning for a tasty weekend breakfast.",
  "authors": [
    "Andree Vaillancourt"
  ],
